<title>UK: Symonds to acquire Calne Group.</title>
<headline>Symonds to acquire Calne Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Printed circuit board manufacturer Symonds Plc said on Friday it is proposing to buy the Calne Group for four million stg.</p>
<p>The company is to fund the acquisition and strengthen the capital base of the group through a 9.6 million stg placing and open offer of shares.</p>
<p>Symonds said the acquisition would enhance its test, design, manufacturing and assembly capabilities and allow it to focus further on the industrial controls and transportation sectors -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
